{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261012/photo/bkn-20261012160609081-1012_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261012174517\"/><p>麗港城有男子猝死。</p><p>今早(12日)10時32分，觀塘麗港街麗港城一單位姓鄭(39歲)男住戶，被家人發現在廁所內暈倒。救援人員接報到場，並破門進入廁所，見到鄭男在裏面昏迷，經檢查證實已經死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T09:59:44.812509+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T08:06:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T10:37:54.317795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:57:52.098761+00:00","content_hash":"031c4c5655d180f60d43e77de188a8f8d0ff9459f164a51557a39fbe5ec36fc4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}